---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GlyphDither from '../components/GlyphDither.astro';
import InstallCommand from '../components/InstallCommand.astro';
---
<Layout title="Hutch: every coding agent gets its own computer" description="Hutch clones boxes from snapshots of your project's environment, keeps terminals running when you disconnect, and sleeps idle boxes, on a Linux machine you rent or own.">
  <div class="page">
  <main>
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">hutch</div>
      <ul><li><a href="#">Docs</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/mouizahmed/hutch">GitHub ↗</a></li></ul>
    </nav>
    <h1>Every coding agent gets its own computer.</h1>
    <InstallCommand />
    <p class="lede">Hutch clones boxes from snapshots of your project's environment, keeps terminals running when you disconnect, and sleeps idle boxes — on a Linux machine you rent or own.</p>
    <p class="muted">Firecracker microVMs where there's KVM. gVisor everywhere else.</p>
    <p class="muted">Works with Claude Code and Codex. Others via a TOML adapter.</p>
    <p class="open">Open source. Apache 2.0 licensed. <a href="https://github.com/mouizahmed/hutch">Star on GitHub ↗</a></p>
    <p class="open">Early software, not yet independently reviewed. <a href="https://github.com/mouizahmed/hutch/blob/main/docs/security.md">Security model ↗</a></p>
  </main>
  <aside><GlyphDither /></aside>
  </div>
</Layout>
